WEBVTT

00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:08.520
(grunting)

00:00:18.988 --> 00:00:19.989
(screams)

00:00:21.908 --> 00:00:23.910
(grunting)

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.041
(muffled scream)

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:31.876
(grunting)

00:00:38.842 --> 00:00:39.843
(sighs)

00:00:41.761 --> 00:00:43.346
(screams)

00:00:45.765 --> 00:00:46.766
(gasps)

00:00:47.642 --> 00:00:48.643
(screams)

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.355
(panting)

00:00:58.486 --> 00:00:59.487
(groaning)

00:01:17.505 --> 00:01:19.007
(Sid sobbing)

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.676
All I wanted is true love.
我只是想要一份真爱

00:01:21.759 --> 00:01:24.304
Is that too much to ask?
这个要求过分吗？

00:01:24.387 --> 00:01:25.388
(Diego groans)

00:01:27.056 --> 00:01:28.391
Why is it so quiet?
怎么这么安静？

00:01:28.474 --> 00:01:31.019
Because the world is mourning my loss.
因为世界都在哀悼我失恋

00:01:31.102 --> 00:01:32.145
-(grunts)
-(screams)

00:01:32.228 --> 00:01:33.479
Ellie?
埃丽？

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:35.064
Peaches?
桃子？

00:01:35.565 --> 00:01:36.983
Where is everyone?
人都去哪了？

00:01:37.066 --> 00:01:38.067
ALL: Surprise!
没想到吧！

00:01:39.277 --> 00:01:40.945
-(all laughing)
-(Crazy In Love playing)

00:01:41.613 --> 00:01:42.989
(blowing noisemakers)

00:01:43.072 --> 00:01:45.074
Uh... Huh?

00:01:48.369 --> 00:01:49.370
BOTH: Ta-da!
塔哒！

00:01:49.829 --> 00:01:51.497
Happy Anniversary, honey!
结婚纪念日快乐，亲爱的！

00:01:51.581 --> 00:01:52.707
Anniversary?
纪念日？

00:01:53.249 --> 00:01:56.085
Oh, no. That's the thing.
哦，不，这就是那件事

00:01:56.169 --> 00:01:57.629
-(giggles)
-(chuckles nervously)

00:01:57.712 --> 00:02:00.340
Okay! Now it's your turn, Bro-Dad!
好吧！该你了，岳父兄弟！

00:02:00.423 --> 00:02:02.216
Yeah! We wanna see what you got Ellie.
耶！我们想看你送给埃丽的礼物

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.468
Manny!
曼尼！

00:02:03.551 --> 00:02:06.888
ALL: Manny! Manny! Manny!
曼尼！曼尼！曼尼！

00:02:06.971 --> 00:02:08.723
Manny!
曼尼！

00:02:08.806 --> 00:02:11.059
Hey, hey. Right.
嘿、嘿，好吧

00:02:11.142 --> 00:02:12.852
Uh... So...

00:02:12.936 --> 00:02:14.771
How about another hand for Ellie?
给埃丽来点掌声如何？

00:02:14.854 --> 00:02:15.980
(chuckling) Yeah.
耶！

00:02:16.397 --> 00:02:17.398
Oh.

00:02:17.941 --> 00:02:19.150
He forgot!
他忘了！

00:02:19.233 --> 00:02:20.234
-(all gasp)
-(faints)

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:22.862
FEMALE GUEST: I feel so bad for Ellie.
埃丽真可怜

00:02:24.072 --> 00:02:26.115
Ellie, I... Uh...
埃丽，我…

00:02:26.908 --> 00:02:28.076
(firework pops)

00:02:29.369 --> 00:02:31.037
(all exclaiming)

00:02:36.417 --> 00:02:39.545
ALL: Ooh! Ah!

00:02:39.629 --> 00:02:41.255
He didn't forget.
他没有忘

00:02:41.339 --> 00:02:43.716
That's how big Manny's love is for her!
曼尼好爱她啊！

00:02:46.135 --> 00:02:48.596
BOTH: Nice save with the light show.
被烟花表演给救了

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.766
Wait, you didn't do this? Then who did?
等等，这不是你干的？那是谁？

00:02:51.849 --> 00:02:53.476
Oh, Manny.
哦，曼尼

00:02:53.559 --> 00:02:55.728
I was so afraid you'd forgotten.
我真的很怕你忘了

00:02:55.812 --> 00:02:58.231
But you lit up the sky for me?
可你为我照亮了整片天空？

00:02:58.314 --> 00:02:59.649
How'd you do it?
你怎么办到的？

00:03:00.024 --> 00:03:01.109
Uh, well...

00:03:01.192 --> 00:03:03.861
A magician never reveals his secrets.
魔术师是不会把魔术手法说出来的

00:03:03.945 --> 00:03:05.571
-(chuckling nervously)
-Oh...

00:03:05.655 --> 00:03:07.031
Thank you.
谢谢

00:03:12.495 --> 00:03:14.372
(children laughing)

00:03:15.415 --> 00:03:17.625
(sighs) I keep picturing
our own kid in there.
我总幻想我们孩子跟人家玩的情景

00:03:17.709 --> 00:03:19.293
He'd be the best one.
他肯定是最棒的

00:03:19.377 --> 00:03:21.629
-I think you meant "she."
-He.
–我想你说的是“她”
–他

00:03:22.171 --> 00:03:24.424
Either way, we've been over this, Diego.
不管怎样，我们说好不谈这个的，迭戈

00:03:24.507 --> 00:03:25.842
Kids are afraid of us.
小孩怕我们

00:03:25.925 --> 00:03:27.301
Yeah, but why?
嗯，可为什么呢？

00:03:27.885 --> 00:03:28.928
(both laughing)

00:03:29.012 --> 00:03:30.013
(both gasp)

00:03:31.264 --> 00:03:33.182
Are they gonna eat us?
他们要吃我们吗？

00:03:33.266 --> 00:03:34.308
Hi, kids!
嗨，孩子们！

00:03:34.392 --> 00:03:35.393
(both screaming)

00:03:37.645 --> 00:03:39.856
I even smiled this time.
我刚才还笑了呢

00:03:40.982 --> 00:03:42.692
(grunting)

00:03:42.775 --> 00:03:43.776
(laughs)

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.153
(muffled grunting)

00:03:46.362 --> 00:03:47.530
-(screams)
-(laughs)

00:03:47.613 --> 00:03:48.698
PEACHES: Wow, Dad.
喔，爸爸

00:03:48.781 --> 00:03:50.533
Best present ever.
这是最棒的礼物

00:03:50.616 --> 00:03:54.203
You, sir, are an education
in marital excellence.
这位先生你真是当丈夫的好榜样

00:03:54.287 --> 00:03:56.706
I'm really gonna miss you guys
when we leave.
我们走了以后，我肯定会想你们的

00:03:56.789 --> 00:03:57.790
(gasps and coughs)
我们走了以后，我肯定会想你们的

00:03:58.124 --> 00:03:59.125
Ow!

00:03:59.709 --> 00:04:02.628
Um, actually, I haven't told them yet.
其实，我还没跟他们说呢

00:04:03.129 --> 00:04:04.255
Oh.

00:04:04.338 --> 00:04:05.882
Surprise!
没想到吧！

00:04:05.965 --> 00:04:07.008
You're leaving?
你们要走？

00:04:07.091 --> 00:04:09.594
I thought you guys were gonna live with us
the first couple of years.
我以为最开始的几年
你们会和我们一起住

00:04:09.677 --> 00:04:11.637
I know. But Julian and I
我知道，可朱利安和我想去旅行一段日子

00:04:11.721 --> 00:04:13.139
kind of want to roam for a while.
我知道，可朱利安和我想去旅行一段日子

00:04:13.222 --> 00:04:14.390
-Roam?
-JULIAN: Yeah!
–旅行？
–对！

00:04:14.474 --> 00:04:17.560
Travel, explore, just go wherever.
旅游，探索，四处走走

00:04:17.643 --> 00:04:20.646
No plan is the best plan.
That's my philosophy.
最好的计划就是没计划
这是我的人生哲学

00:04:21.314 --> 00:04:22.315
Hors d'oeuvres?
来点开胃菜？

00:04:22.398 --> 00:04:24.442
That's not a plan, or a philosophy,
那不是计划，也不是人生哲学…

00:04:24.525 --> 00:04:25.735
or very safe.
也不安全

00:04:26.319 --> 00:04:27.737
(chuckles) Dad, we're young.
爸爸，我们是年轻人

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.406
We can worry about being safe
when we're old and boring.
等我们老了、闷了，再考虑安全也不迟

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:31.574
Like you and Mom.
就像你和妈妈

00:04:31.657 --> 00:04:33.576
-I think we should just...
-Excuse me!
–我觉得我们应该…
–不好意思！

00:04:33.659 --> 00:04:35.244
This is a family discussion.
我们家人在商量事

00:04:35.328 --> 00:04:37.330
But aren't I part of your family?
可我不是你们家人吗？

00:04:37.413 --> 00:04:38.873
Not yet, you're not.
还不是

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.001
(slurps)

00:04:44.003 --> 00:04:45.088
Uh...

00:04:45.171 --> 00:04:47.256
Does that look like a problem to you?
你觉得那个有问题吗？

00:04:50.218 --> 00:04:52.595
A ball of fire heading directly towards us?
一个火球朝我们直冲过来？

00:04:52.678 --> 00:04:54.097
Why would that be a problem?
有什么问题？

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.765
What if you fall in a ditch and get amnesia?
你要是掉到沟里失忆了呢？怎么办？

00:04:55.848 --> 00:04:57.100
What then, huh?
你要是掉到沟里失忆了呢？怎么办？

00:04:57.183 --> 00:04:58.267
Manny, we have a problem.
曼尼，有麻烦了

00:04:58.351 --> 00:04:59.977
Not now. I have a problem.
现在别烦我，我也有麻烦

00:05:00.061 --> 00:05:01.270
This one's a little bigger.
这个更麻烦

00:05:01.354 --> 00:05:02.814
-I don't think so.
-Manny!
–我不觉得
–曼尼！

00:05:02.897 --> 00:05:04.065
What?
干吗？

00:05:04.524 --> 00:05:05.525
(gasps)

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.278
-(yelps)
-Manny?
曼尼？

00:05:09.362 --> 00:05:12.031
Uh, okay. Party's over, everybody.
好吧，聚会结束了，各位

00:05:12.115 --> 00:05:14.283
Have a good night. And leave right now!
晚安，马上走！

00:05:14.367 --> 00:05:16.661
What are you talking about?
The party just got started.
你说什么呢？聚会才开始

00:05:16.744 --> 00:05:17.787
Yeah.
是啊

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:20.123
(yawns) Just getting kind of sleepy.
我有点困了

00:05:20.206 --> 00:05:23.209
Everyone should go.
And duck. Possibly cover!
大家都该走了，找个掩护！躲起来！

00:05:23.292 --> 00:05:25.211
Hey, what's gotten into you?
嘿，你怎么了？

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:26.921
(gasps)

00:05:32.927 --> 00:05:35.596
-Look! There's more coming!
-(all gasping)
看！还有！

00:05:37.598 --> 00:05:39.267
Meteor shower!
是流星雨！

00:05:40.059 --> 00:05:41.310
(gasps) Meteor?
流星？

00:05:41.394 --> 00:05:42.436
(sniffs) Shower?
雨？

00:05:44.939 --> 00:05:47.316
(gasps) Manny's love is killing us!
曼尼的爱要置我们于死地了！

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:50.194
I suppose this is all part
of your magic show for me?
我猜这都是你给我准备的魔术表演？

00:05:50.278 --> 00:05:52.071
(chuckles nervously) Abracadabra?
妈咪妈咪哄？

00:05:52.155 --> 00:05:53.656
Can you guys deal with this later?
你们能之后再吵吗？

00:05:53.739 --> 00:05:55.408
Come on. We need to take cover.
快点，我们得躲起来

00:05:55.491 --> 00:05:57.076
(panicked screaming)
快点，我们得躲起来

00:05:59.453 --> 00:06:01.747
Whoo-hoo! I'm on fire!
我着火了！

00:06:02.081 --> 00:06:05.585
Whoo-hoo-hoo! Me too!
We're smoking hot, baby!
我也是！我们性感得冒烟了，宝贝！

00:06:06.252 --> 00:06:07.587
(both screaming)

00:06:08.129 --> 00:06:09.380
ELLIE: Incoming!
来了！

00:06:09.463 --> 00:06:10.756
Those are ours!
是自己人！

00:06:11.799 --> 00:06:13.759
Are you okay? How many tusks do you see?
没事吧？你们看到几个象牙？

00:06:13.843 --> 00:06:15.678
-Tree.
-Three?
树

00:06:15.761 --> 00:06:17.597
No! Tree!
不是！是树！

00:06:19.098 --> 00:06:20.099
(Manny gasps)

00:06:20.933 --> 00:06:22.268
(all yelp)

00:06:25.938 --> 00:06:27.773
Everybody, jump!
所有人，跳！

00:06:27.857 --> 00:06:29.150
(all grunt)
所有人，跳！

00:06:32.195 --> 00:06:33.863
(all panting)

00:06:36.324 --> 00:06:37.950
Whee!

00:06:38.492 --> 00:06:40.536
MANNY: The cave! Get inside!
那个洞！进去！

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:41.871
Move! Move!
快！快！

00:06:44.332 --> 00:06:46.083
-Whoa!
-Whoa!

00:06:46.167 --> 00:06:47.168
(grunts)

00:06:49.795 --> 00:06:51.714
(whimpering)

00:06:51.797 --> 00:06:52.798
(both gasp)

00:06:53.549 --> 00:06:54.592
-MANNY: Oh!
-(Peaches gasps)

00:06:54.675 --> 00:06:56.510
It's okay, sweetheart. Daddy's...
没事，宝贝，爸爸在…

00:06:57.386 --> 00:06:59.180
(breathing heavily)

00:07:02.475 --> 00:07:04.060
-(crashing)
-(all grunt)

00:07:07.647 --> 00:07:09.398
Hey, it sounds like it's slowing down.
听上去好像变弱了

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.985
Yup, it's definitely over.
对，肯定结束了

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:20.034
(chuckling nervously)
Except for that one.
除了那个

00:07:21.661 --> 00:07:25.331
MANNY: We might wanna think
about moving underground for a while. MANNY: We might wanna think
about moving underground for a while.
我们或许该暂时搬到地下躲躲 我们或许该暂时搬到地下躲躲

